Package: heks-toon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, guile-3.0
Description: keyboard reference, wallpaper and palette chooser in one window
 heks-toon is the window behind three of this desktop's questions: which key
 does what, which wallpaper is on screen, and which palette the whole session
 should wear.  The C half draws with GTK4 and the Scheme half decides, so the
 keyboard reference is rendered from the same binding tables the compositors
 are configured from rather than from a second copy of them.
